{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11555","headline":"西阁二首 一 · 杜甫","name":"西阁二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山小摇落，碧色见松林。\n百鸟各相命，孤云无自心。\n层轩俯江壁，要路亦高深。\n朱绂犹纱帽，新诗近玉琴。\n功名不早立，衰病谢知音。\n哀世非王粲，终然学越吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}